+             Attaining Arbitrary Role-play via Self-Alignment},
+      author={Keming Lu and Bowen Yu and Chang Zhou and Jingren Zhou},
+      year={2024},
+      eprint={2401.12474},
+      archivePrefix={arXiv},
+      primaryClass={cs.CL}
+}
+```
